description:
@Fayeknightly @peja and @JazzySkye from @FunSquadFamily had so much fun dancing to this viral tiktok trend! do you fight with your siblings? what other viral tiktok sounds have you seen in your shorts feed? who else loves doing new trending dances on youtube shorts? we post one short a day and that helps with gaining subscribers! it's also fun to dance to new music! what other new music is trending now on youtube? what famous tiktokers are postings new dances? this was so much fun to do at the @TheNinjaFam new action park! lots of new videos coming soon! 
did you watch our recent videos?
